    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "REA John Lee are delighted to present this spacious detached dormer style bungalow situated in the highly sought-after Gardenhill area of Castleconnell. Extending to approximately 171 sq.m. and standing on a mature site of c. 0.14 hectares, the property offers generous accommodation, excellent potential and a superb opportunity for purchasers seeking a family home in a convenient and attractive location.\nThe residence is presented in good overall structural form but would benefit from redecoration and modernisation throughout, allowing the successful purchaser to place their own stamp on the property. The layout provides bright and well-proportioned living space, with the dormer design offering flexible accommodation suitable for family living, home working or those seeking additional space in a peaceful residential setting.\nExternally, the property stands on a manageable mature site of c. 0.14 hectares, offering garden space, parking and scope for further landscaping or enhancement. This is an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial detached home in one of the most desirable residential locations in the Castleconnell area."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Mains ESB, Mains Water, Oil Fired Central Heating, Septic tank. All windows are double glazed pvc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER Number: 105245260, Energy Performance Indicator: 211.19kWh/m²/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Gardenhill is a popular and established location on the outskirts of Castleconnell village, an area renowned for its scenic riverside walks, village amenities, schools, sporting facilities and strong community atmosphere. The property enjoys the benefit of a quiet setting while remaining within easy reach of Limerick City, University of Limerick, Castletroy, Annacotty and the M7 motorway network."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Negotiator",
        "SortOrder": 10,
        "Content": "James Lee"
      }
